One item on this: A reminder that travel for fieldwork requires an approved=
 authorization before booking, and that per diem is claimed at the rate for=
 the duty location rather than the rate for the office. Receipts are requir=
ed for any expense over $75. Vouchers submitted more than thirty days after=
 return are returned for explanation. Raise it with me rather than with the=
 branch directly.